    "detailed_description": "Pillars is an adventure platformer where there is one simple goal: Reach the top. Run, jump, launch, and slam your way up and around the six Pillars. Enjoy the free movement of the skies and traverse a multitude of environments hand-crafted for the best platforming experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n- Fluid movement system: responsive, fun movement makes climbing an already fun experience, combined with-<br />\r\n- Interesting Abilities: Launch and slam in different combinations to find the best way up!<br />\r\n- Calm, relaxing experience<br />\r\n- Beautiful levels and level design",
